Let source be "ADOBECODEBANC".
Let target be "ABC".
Let source last be the last position of source.
Let target last be the last position of target.
Let need be an empty map.
For every position from 0 to target last.
Let symbol be character position of target.
Add 1 to entry symbol of need.

Let window be an empty map.
Let required be the number of entries in need.
Let formed be 0.
Let left be 0.
Let best start be 0.
Let best length be 1000000.
For every right from 0 to source last.
Let symbol be character right of source.
Add 1 to entry symbol of window.
If need has entry symbol and entry symbol of window is entry symbol of need, add 1 to formed.
Repeat while formed is required.
Let width be right minus left plus 1.
If width is less than best length, set best start to left, set best length to width.
Let mark be character left of source.
Subtract 1 from entry mark of window.
If need has entry mark and entry mark of window is less than entry mark of need, subtract 1 from formed.
Add 1 to left.

Let finish be best start plus best length.
Let answer be the slice of source from best start to finish.
Print answer.
